 Sustain. Food Syst.6. doi:10.3389/fsufs.2022.1053921CrossRefGoogle Scholar33ZhangE.ZhangN.LiF.LvC.(2024a).A lightweight dual-attention network for tomato leaf disease identification.Front. Plant Sci.15. doi:10.3389/fpls.2024.1420584Pubmed AbstractCrossRefGoogle Scholar34ZhangX.FengG.SunX.(2024b).Advanced technologies of soil moisture monitoring in precision agriculture: A review.J. Agric. Food Res.18,101473. doi:10.1016/j.jafr.2024.101473CrossRefGoogle ScholarSummaryKeywordsagentic AI,agriculture,crop monitoring,precision farming,SWOT analysisCitationSrinivasu PN, Pavate A, JayaLakshmi G, Shafi J, Choi J and Ijaz MF (2026)Agentic AI for smart and sustainable precision agriculture.Front. Plant Sci.16:1706428. doi:10.3389/fpls.2025.1706428Received18 September 2025Revised05 December 2025Accepted08 December 2025Published14 January 2026Volume16 - 2025Edited byKai Huang, Jiangsu Academy of Agricultural Sciences (JAAS), ChinaReviewed byArslan Yousaf, Hamad Bin Khalifa University, QatarNazish Aijaz, Hunan University, ChinaMd Wali Ullah, Westcliff University, United StatesUpdatesCheck for updatesCopyright© 2026 Srinivasu, Pavate, JayaLakshmi, Shafi, Choi and Ijaz.This is an open-access article distributed under the terms of theCreative Commons Attribution License (CC BY). The use, distribution or reproduction in other forums is permitted, provided the original author(s) and the copyright owner(s) are credited and that the original publication in this journal is cited, in accordance with accepted academic practice. No use, distribution or reproduction is permitted which does not comply with these terms.*Correspondence: Jaeyoung Choi,jychoi19@gachon.ac.kr; Muhammad Fazal Ijaz,muhammadfazal.ijaz@torrens.edu.auDisclaimerAll claims expressed in this article are solely those of the authors and do not necessarily represent those of their affiliated organizations, or those of the publisher, the editors and the reviewers. Any product that may be evaluated in this article or claim that may be made by its manufacturer is not guaranteed or endorsed by the publisher.",
